OL,3,GNEWSAMobile phones seized in
OL,4,Ainvestigation linked to right-wing
OL,5,Aextremism
OL,6,
OL,7,FItems including six mobile phones have
OL,8,Fbeen seized after a police search
OL,9,Foperation in the west Belfast area on
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,12,FThe items were seized from two
OL,13,Fproperties by the Police Service of
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland's (PSNI) Terrorism
OL,15,FInvestigation Unit in connection with a
OL,16,Fwider investigation into right-wing
OL,17,Fextremism.
OL,19,FPolice said the items that were seized
OL,20,Fon Thursday will now be taken away for
OL,21,Ffurther forensic examination.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
