OL,5,Aextremism
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI also said an
OL,8,Finvestigation into explosive devices
OL,9,Fdiscovered in Belfast at the weekend is
OL,10,Flinked to "extreme right-wing
OL,11,Fterrorism".
